{"id": "DfeNgTBDl-T", "title": "Video by vedastovikings", "description": "She rejected every god. Except one. 🪔\n\nTonight millions pray to Lakshmi. But how does she choose? When she rose from the churned ocean of milk, every god, demon and sage wanted her. The Bhagavata Purana (8.8.19-24) says she looked at each of them and found something missing in every one. Then she laid her lotus garland on the only one who did not want her.\n\nShe wasn't looking for power, wisdom or fame. She looked for goodness without a flaw, in one who did not crave her.\n\nTonight, before you light her lamp, ask: would she choose you? Tell us in the comments 👇\nHappy Diwali from Vedas to Vikings 🙏\n\n#diwali #lakshmipuja #bhagavatapurana #hindumythology #vedastovikings", "channel": "vedastovikings", "uploader_id": "60997589521", "uploader": "Vedas to Vikings | Mythology films", "timestamp": 1794122644, "like_count": 9138, "comment_count": 45, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-17960099838037522a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 61.792, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNJZ8dwn83fOZ2RMj_m0UmSSruSeEDPpqB8oYtv_-zxxamMf-YYaIsyVQ_952NkHu2Q4H8K1PfCJCJEyvrK8ICXWDfRtrSSCVzRAEM.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=Adp0JRm-29pD7jpizHgy2GUr-i1_Tl4sXE9W2pa5dkZe_Kzu4IhiOlCp1Z6Fh0RQWLvjctYpqC9FnnQt4LZ61ITd&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=_c6LhPnbMXkQ7kNvwFvLqd7&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=ecfnaTiYlPFlAzF1zsfRUQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRmH4Qbb-rWcN3CNsV6s2xUToCpmBdwjKgcQqd2li98NQ&oe=6AF4468A", "manifest_str