 relates with us is good!", "timestamp": 1794216983, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "tnmy_75", "author_id": "61212347963", "id": "18120350234007088", "text": "Teri dristhi matra mera moksh..🙏🪷✨", "timestamp": 1794216060, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "just__luvonly", "author_id": "71620696507", "id": "17905228410604631", "text": "Wrong story laxmi ji was already eternal wife of lord Vishnu ji ,but due to curse by some saint she was cursed and separated and she appeared again from ocean as ocean daughter and tgen she reunited with her husband vishnu ji", "timestamp": 1794204160, "like_count": 157}, {"author": "tejalkhorava", "author_id": "1557102633", "id": "18119726429600741", "text": "Jai Shri Lakshmi Narayan 🙏🙇‍♀️🪷", "timestamp": 1794201285, "like_count": 5}, {"author": "sibraj_rabha", "author_id": "73681588915", "id": "18148617385569687", "text": "❤️", "timestamp": 1794200705, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "kiran_acharya_1101", "author_id": "77805176309", "id": "18114390628875354", "text": "🔥👏", "timestamp": 1794187861, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "vedastovikings", "author_id": "60997589521", "id": "17953915212300464", "text": "@mayank.rawal27 Good question. The Bhagavata (8.8.20-24) never names anyone: it lists what she found missing in each kind of being and leaves the names to us. Who do you think fits which flaw?", "timestamp": 1794170785, "like_count": 3}, {"author": "vedastovikings", "author_id": "60997589521", "id": "18079479401446118", "text": "@__mrbob_ Beautifully put. Many traditions hold exactly that: Shri is never apart from Narayana, and the churning only brought her back into the world. The Bhagavata tells it as her choice, and both can be true.", "timestamp": 1794170755, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "vaidehirajput234", "author_id": "44284431400", "id": "17904986277607221", "text": "🙏🪷", "timestamp": 1794160980, "like_count": 2}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DfeNgTBDl-T/", "webpage_url_basename": "DfeNgTBDl-T", "webpage_url_domain": "i